    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Hide Price Until Login allows store owners to hide product prices and disable purchasing for guests.</p>\n<p>Features:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Hide price for non-logged-in users</li>\n<li>Remove Add to Cart button for guests</li>\n<li>Custom login message</li>\n<li>Simple settings page</li>\n<li>Lightweight and secure</li>\n<li>WooCommerce compatible</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Perfect for:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Wholesale stores</li>\n<li>B2B stores</li>\n<li>Membership shops</li>\n<li>Price-on-request stores</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to /wp-content/plugins/</li>\n<li>Activate via Plugins menu</li>\n<li>Go to WooCommerce &gt; Hide Price Until Login</li>\n<li>Configure your message</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"does%20this%20work%20for%20variable%20products%3F\">\nDoes this work for variable products?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. Prices for simple and variable products are hidden.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"does%20it%20disable%20checkout%20for%20guests%3F\">\nDoes it disable checkout for guests?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. Guests cannot purchase products.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Hide WooCommerce product prices and Add to Cart button for guest users.",
    "description": "<p>Hide Price Until Login allows store owners to hide product prices and disable purchasing for guests.</p>\n<p>Features:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Hide price for non-logged-in users</li>\n<li>Remove Add to Cart button for guests</li>\n<li>Custom login message</li>\n<li>Simple settings page</li>\n<li>Lightweight and secure</li>\n<li>WooCommerce compatible</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Perfect for:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Wholesale stores</li>\n<li>B2B stores</li>\n<li>Membership shops</li>\n<li>Price-on-request stores</li>\n</ul>\n",
